{
 "text": "If these people are going in to change the color of their car, why not do it before they come in? When it comes to businesses having a website, it's not about colors, it's not about how the website looks, it's not about how website feels, but it's all about visualizing the process of your business. So yesterday I was cold calling and pitching my ideas, and I came across this car wrapping, protective film installing business. So I built this custom AI component into their website. When somebody uploads the photo of their car, they choose the color and see the end result, and AI does its magic and spits out an image of the car being wrapped in that color. And from there, they could just book a meeting or get a quote for the businesses, which could lead to more traffic coming into the business, which means more money, which means overall better business, right? So I do this all the time. I could think of millions of different ways this thought process could be applied to many different businesses, and if you want the same for your business, then hit me up.",
 "audio_duration_secs": 59.933334,
